cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Machine Learning Mapping of HIV-TB Co-infection across Ghana's 261 Districts"
abstract: >
  Reproducible pipeline for spatial distribution, determinants, and ML-based risk
  prediction of HIV-TB co-infection across Ghana's 261 administrative districts
  (post-2018 Local Governance Act). Combines spatial statistics (Moran's I, LISA,
  Gi*, GWR), geographically weighted regression, and ensemble machine learning
  (RandomForest, XGBoost, LightGBM, Stacked). Dataset deduplicated (5 records
  removed); Guan District added. Canonical statistics (seed=42, 261 districts):
  Moran's I=0.810 (HIV-TB), Bivariate=0.449; GWR R²=0.916; LightGBM AUC=0.998
  (LODO-CV). All 261 districts now have distinct, computed values.
